---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro'
import Section from '../components/Section.astro'
import CodeBlock from '../components/CodeBlock.astro'
---
<Base title={'Developers — Ommisa'} description={'Everything the command-line interface does is available over HTTP, together with an MCP server for AI agents.'}>
<div class="page-narrow prose">
  <Hero title="Developers" lede="Everything the command-line interface does is available over HTTP, together with an MCP server for AI agents.">
  </Hero>

  <Section id="http" title="The HTTP API">
    <CodeBlock title="POST /api/ask" code={`curl -s https://ai.oimlsmart.org/api/ask \\
  -H 'content-type: application/json' \\
  -d '{"query":"What is OIML R 60?","stream":false}'`} />
    <p class="m-0">The answer document carries the <code>answer</code> text, the <code>citations</code> array with the quality and status of each source, the <code>confidence_note</code> statement, the <code>source_quality</code> rung, the <code>entailment</code> measurement and the <code>quota</code> echo. Requests with <code>stream:true</code> answer with server-sent events that report the interpretation of the question, the citations, the answer tokens and the completion. The complete surface is described by the <a href="https://ai.oimlsmart.org/api/openapi.json">OpenAPI document</a>, which covers asking, search, absence, verification, research and the member-data routes. The Model Context Protocol (MCP) server speaks at <code>https://ai.oimlsmart.org/mcp</code>.</p>
  </Section>

  <Section id="auth" title="Authentication">
    <p class="m-0">Anonymous callers receive the public tier and are rate limited by address. Members authenticate at the OIML SMART identity service, <a href="https://id.oimlsmart.org">id.oimlsmart.org</a>. The web application uses the authorization-code flow with Proof Key for Code Exchange (PKCE), and command-line clients use the Device Authorization Grant (RFC 8628), which issues a personal access token scoped with the <code>&lt;service&gt;:&lt;read|write|admin&gt;</code> grammar. Resource servers confirm every token through RFC 7662 introspection, so a revocation or a role change takes effect within seconds.</p>
  </Section>

  <Section id="programme" title="The OIML SMART programme">
    <ul class="m-0">
      <li><a href="https://ai.oimlsmart.org/">ai.oimlsmart.org</a> — the Ommisa web application</li>
      <li><a href="https://id.oimlsmart.org">id.oimlsmart.org</a> — the identity service and account console</li>
      <li><a href="https://www.oimlsmart.org/certificates/">the OIML-CS certificate browser</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.oimlsmart.org/">oimlsmart.org</a> — the OIML SMART programme</li>
    </ul>
  </Section>
</div>
</Base>
